                      <div  class="layout__region--second layout__region layout__region--content">
              <div class="elemental-margin-bottom block block-layout-builder block-field-blocktopiccountyfield-highlights">
  
    
      

<div class="field field--name-field-highlights field--type-text-long field--label-above border border-color-primary/[0.35] rounded-[5px] bg-color-bg-light p-4">
  <h2 class="field__label heading-3">Highlights</h2>
        <div class="field__item"><p>Statewide resources are available under the top navigation menu. To access El Paso County site sections, utilize the "Section menu" drop down menu or the section links provided below.</p><ul><li>Service by Publication<ul><li>Domestic: <a href="/media/15929" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="f17efe95-c109-4862-a014-179df58116cd" data-entity-substitution="canonical">Consolidated Notice of Pending Actions</a>; <a href="/media/16586" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="f8167a62-7c2f-488b-a751-d24cb3bde5ea" data-entity-substitution="canonical">APR Summons</a> (APR Summons <a href="/media/16587" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="2d320cc3-1492-4649-9c19-6319e7133900" data-entity-substitution="canonical">Spanish</a>); <a href="/media/16588" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="4fd9a1a3-5fa7-405b-a388-0adae8080e1c" data-entity-substitution="canonical">DM Summons</a> (DM Summons <a href="/media/16589" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="ef50fd36-ec85-4a5c-9047-9a1cb3149256" data-entity-substitution="canonical">Spanish</a>); <a href="/media/16590" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="9177a20d-9b09-48d4-b5a3-88ffa88a603e" data-entity-substitution="canonical">Certificate of Mailing (Publication)</a>; <a href="/media/16897" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="a04f5336-c5cb-4532-b49b-85f3e01e4b57" data-entity-substitution="canonical">CV Summons by Publication</a></li></ul></li><li><a href="/e-filing-non-attorneys">E-Filing for Non-Attorneys</a> - File documents online in Divorce, Legal Separation, and Custody cases</li><li><a href="http://www.courtcare.org/">Court Care</a><span> - Free childcare for parents doing court business.</span></li><li><a href="/media/11242">Interested in Volunteering with the Court?</a> For more information contact <a href="mailto:D04_volunteer@judicial.state.co.us ">D04_volunteer@judicial.state.co.us</a>.</li><li><a href="https://forms.office.com/Pages/ResponsePage.aspx?id=_A6cO2uhUU2AiG4p3PKgd5TH9RTzK_tLrGMw0i26p2ZUMUlGNEhUUloxNlpMOTlDNFpNSjJMQkRONiQlQCN0PWcu&amp;utm_source=4th&amp;utm_medium=web&amp;utm_campaign=survey&amp;utm_id=4th&amp;utm_term=4th&amp;utm_content=4th">Colorado Court User Survey</a> - Help improve services.</li></ul><p><strong>Clerk's Office Room S101:</strong><span> Closes at </span><strong>3:30 p.m</strong><span>. on the 3rd Wednesday of each month in 2026 (1/21, 2/18, 3/18, 4/15, 5/20, 6/17, 7/15, 8/19, 9/16, 10/21, 11/18, 12/16)</span></p><p><strong>**Effective Oct. 1, 2026 - Temporary Protection Order (TPO) cut off will be 2 p.m.**</strong></p><p><strong>**Effective Tuesday Oct. 6, 2026 - Temporary Protection Orders (TPOs) will no longer be held via WebEx. Must appear in person. TPO docket will be heard at 3 PM. Please refer to paperwork for the correct courtroom or see monitor for location.**</strong></p><p><span><strong>BONDED ADVISEMENTS are held in Division DST Fridays at 10 a.m.</strong></span></p><p><span><strong>Weddings and Civil Unions information is located at the bottom of </strong></span><a href="https://www.coloradojudicial.gov/courts/trial-courts/el-paso-county/self-help-resources?topic=27&amp;wrapped=true"><strong>Self-Help Resources</strong></a> page.</p><p><strong>Family Court Facilitator (FCF) contact information is located at the bottom of </strong><a href="https://www.coloradojudicial.gov/courts/trial-courts/el-paso-county/self-help-center"><strong>Self-Help Center</strong></a> page.</p></div>
    </div>

  </div>
<div class="block__elemental_component--text block__elemental_component--text--bordered block block-elemental block-elemental-component-blocktext">
  
    
      

<div class="elemental_component text text--bordered border border-color-primary/[0.35] rounded-[5px] bg-color-bg-light elemental-margin-bottom p-4">
  
            <div class="field text--field-text field-text field__text--bordered clearfix text-formatted field--name-field-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><h3>Quick Links</h3><ul><li data-list-item-id="e34f6d678ab3dc0e3a8cb6ccd74f609c1"><a href="/jury-information?topic=27&amp;wrapped=true">Jury Information</a></li><li data-list-item-id="e4889d20a3378a4fb4fa6338691b3d582"><a href="/courts/trial-courts/el-paso-county/el-paso-county-probation?topic=27&amp;wrapped=true">Probation</a></li><li data-list-item-id="e5fcb7bb67e1f99a597d6505b8047393e"><a href="/livestream-and-virtual-courtrooms?topic=27&amp;wrapped=true">Virtual Courtrooms</a></li><li data-list-item-id="e1b6423279abf9cf5b35b78e25a977bf3"><a href="/courts/trial-courts/el-paso-county/4th-judicial-district-el-paso?topic=27&amp;wrapped=true">Bond Hearing Schedule</a></li><li data-list-item-id="eff9b1083d808c95adeaf99fa79146acf"><a href="/chief-judge-orders-and-directives?topic=27&amp;wrapped=true">Chief Judge Orders</a></li><li data-list-item-id="e26f746e29e73d11a5d6672030aabd6bb"><a href="/courts/trial-courts/el-paso-county/el-paso-county-judges-and-staff?topic=27&amp;wrapped=true">Judges and Staff</a></li><li data-list-item-id="ef04bb3020ed90a9d145fe99c508d58ee"><a href="/courts/trial-courts/el-paso-county/problem-solving-and-specialty-courts?topic=27&amp;wrapped=true">Problem Solving Courts</a></li><li data-list-item-id="ee4ebdac4b14a2c1376bcd2a7631505c5"><a href="/courts/trial-courts/el-paso-county/self-help-resources?topic=27&amp;wrapped=true">Self Help Resources</a></li><li data-list-item-id="ecacf6d36889b4322f8e706e9d0014987"><a href="/courts/trial-courts/collections-payments-d04" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="38f26ea6-484d-4307-bdb9-f21ff05a6edc" data-entity-substitution="canonical">Collections &amp; Payments</a></li><li data-list-item-id="e85b2289abc5c48bee55b5a52b954b025"><a href="https://www.coloradojudicial.gov/courts/trial-courts/el-paso-county/forms-el-paso-county">Settings for All Case Types-How to make your appointment</a></li></ul></div>
