            <div class="field text--field-text field-text field__text--default clearfix text-formatted field--name-field-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><ul><li><strong>Records Request</strong> - Complete the <a href="/media/11252" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="03abd471-5355-4b4d-8aed-e3da5c830a5d" data-entity-substitution="canonical">Records Request Form</a> and email it to <a href="mailto:04ResearchRequest@judicial.state.co.us">04ResearchRequest@judicial.state.co.us</a>. To access the <a href="/node/3531">online Records Request form, click here</a>. Records may also be requested in Room S101 of the courthouse. For questions, call <a href="tel:719-452-5490">(719) 452-5490</a>.</li><li><strong>Transcript Request</strong> - To request a written transcript of a court hearing, complete the <a href="/media/1526" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="5bea714a-8ff4-4b89-a573-f016fdbc6334" data-entity-substitution="canonical">Transcript Request Form</a> and email it to <a href="mailto:04TranscriptRequest@judicial.state.co.us">04TranscriptRequest@judicial.state.co.us</a>. Please note that audio recordings are not available.</li></ul></div>
